From: LibreMoto Build <libre-moto@jacksitlab.de>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:57:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(aidl): expose nearby roads vector data via
 getNearbyRoads()

Add AIDL V2 method getNearbyRoads(centerLat, centerLon, radiusM, maxRoads)
that queries loaded .obf vector tiles for road polylines within a bbox.
Returns List<ARoadPolyline> with WGS84 points, road name, and highway type.
Uses BinaryMapIndexReader.searchMapIndex + LINE_RULES highway-tag filter.
